#: CHANGES_LOG.md:3
msgid "当检测到了应用保活开始的时候, 会停止脚本."
msgstr "The script stops when app keep-alive is detected."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:4
msgid "修改了游戏是否启动的检测方法, 不再依赖简单的图片尺寸, 而是使用更准确的判断."
msgstr "Game-running detection now uses a more accurate check instead of relying on image dimensions."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:5
msgid "当截图返回数据包含警告信息的时候, 将不会尝试删除警告信息, 而是在打印了错误信息后跳过所有警告信息的输出."
msgstr "When screenshot data contains a warning, the error is logged and warning output is suppressed for subsequent captures."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:6
msgid "修复了挖矿在回城过程中重启时, 脚本无法继续的问题."
msgstr "Fixed mining failing to resume after a restart while returning to town."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:7
msgid "战斗策略中支持的角色添加了赛德."
msgstr "Added Zeid to the characters supported by battle strategies."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:15
msgid "修复了选择0号显示器会导致脚本无法运行的问题."
msgstr "Fixed selecting display 0 preventing the script from running."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:16
msgid "那些警告模拟器多显示的朋友们, 我只能说警告就让它警告吧."
msgstr "Multiple-display warnings from the emulator are now allowed through."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:19
msgid "修复了mumu15对模拟器多显示器的警告会导致截图数据无法识别的问题."
msgstr "Fixed MuMu 15 multi-display warnings preventing screenshot recognition."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:20
msgid "现在如果模拟器具有多个显示器, 会选择默认显示器."
msgstr "The default display is now selected when the emulator has multiple displays."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:21
msgid "另: 宣布进入mumu15时代. mumu12已切割."
msgstr "Added MuMu 15 support and ended MuMu 12 support."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:24
msgid "战斗策略新增加了普利修和巴克什."
msgstr "Added Prishe and Bakesh to battle strategies."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:25
msgid "新增了5f底部2精英的任务."
msgstr "Added the FFXI 5F bottom two-elites task."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:28
msgid "现在通过event进本的时候, 如果已经在副本中, 那么将会结束进本流程."
msgstr "EVENT entry now ends the entry flow when the party is already inside the dungeon."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:29
msgid "优化了从EVENt进本时的判断图片, 以避免可能的错误点击."
msgstr "Improved EVENT entry templates to reduce accidental clicks."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:30
msgid "完善了挖矿提示, 以避免误报."
msgstr "Improved mining guidance to reduce false positives."

#: CHANGES_LOG.md:31
msgid "现在挖矿任务可以在挖矿中途停止."
msgstr "Mining tasks can now be stopped while mining is in progress."

