#: resources/quest/quest.json:874
msgid ""
"请按照如下步骤设置:\n"
"1 购买9999个鹤嘴锄并保存在仓库里\n"
"2 六人队伍脱掉所有装备, 然后尽可能多的携带鹤嘴锄\n"
"3 在王城的工会里新建一个队伍, 并命名为FFXIStone.\n"
"4 前往活动地图2F, 在哈肯正对的矿点前, 打上标记.\n"
"5 确保这是该层唯一的标记.\n"
"6 副本或主城中启动脚本."
msgstr ""
"Follow these setup steps:\n"
"1. Buy 9,999 pickaxes and store them in the warehouse.\n"
"2. Unequip all gear from the six-member party, then carry as many pickaxes as possible.\n"
"3. Create a new party at the Royal City guild and name it FFXIStone.\n"
"4. On event map 2F, place a marker at the mining point directly in front of Harken.\n"
"5. Make sure this is the only marker on the floor.\n"
"6. Start the script from a dungeon or the city."
